#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:4
msgid "BGP Neighbors"
msgstr "Vizinhos BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:6
msgid "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > BGP``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Routers > (select Router) > BGP``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:11
msgid ""
"The BGP (Border Gateway Protocol) tab on a network router provides "
"management of BGP neighbor (peer) configurations. BGP is the primary "
"exterior gateway protocol used for routing between autonomous systems on "
"the Internet and within large enterprise networks. |morpheus| supports "
"configuring BGP neighbors on router types that expose this capability, "
"such as NSX Tier-0 Gateways."
msgstr "A aba BGP (Border Gateway Protocol) em um roteador de rede fornece o gerenciamento de configurações de vizinhos (peers) BGP. BGP é o principal protocolo de gateway exterior usado para roteamento entre sistemas autônomos na Internet e em grandes redes empresariais. O |morpheus| oferece suporte à configuração de vizinhos BGP em tipos de roteador que expõem essa capacidade, como NSX Tier-0 Gateways."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:52
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:13
msgid ""
"The BGP tab is available on router types that support BGP (``hasBgp`` "
"flag). Currently, NSX Tier-0 Gateways are the primary router type with "
"BGP neighbor support in |morpheus|."
msgstr "A aba BGP está disponível em tipos de roteador que suportam BGP (flag ``hasBgp``). Atualmente, NSX Tier-0 Gateways são o principal tipo de roteador com suporte a vizinhos BGP no |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:16
msgid "Viewing BGP Neighbors"
msgstr "Visualizando Vizinhos BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:18
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:59
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:69
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Routers``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Network > Routers``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:19
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:29
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:60
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:70
msgid "Click on the target router to access the detail view"
msgstr "Clique no roteador de destino para acessar a visualização de detalhes"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:30
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:61
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:71
msgid "Click the **BGP** tab"
msgstr "Clique na aba **BGP**"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:21
msgid ""
"The list view displays BGP neighbors with their IP address, Remote AS, "
"and status information"
msgstr "A visualização de lista exibe vizinhos BGP com seu endereço IP, Remote AS e informações de status"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:23
msgid ""
"Use the search bar to filter neighbors by IP address, remote AS number, "
"or description."
msgstr "Use a barra de busca para filtrar vizinhos por endereço IP, número de AS remoto ou descrição."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:26
msgid "Adding a BGP Neighbor"
msgstr "Adicionando um Vizinho BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:31
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:32
msgid "Complete the configuration fields:"
msgstr "Preencha os campos de configuração:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "IP Address"
msgstr "Endereço IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:34
msgid "The IP address of the BGP neighbor"
msgstr "O endereço IP do vizinho BGP"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Remote AS"
msgstr "Remote AS"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:35
msgid "The Autonomous System number of the remote peer"
msgstr "O número do Autonomous System do peer remoto"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Forwarding Address"
msgstr "Forwarding Address"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:36
msgid "(optional) The forwarding address for the neighbor"
msgstr "(Opcional) O endereço de forwarding do vizinho"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Protocol Address"
msgstr "Protocol Address"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:37
msgid "(optional) The protocol address for the neighbor"
msgstr "(Opcional) O endereço de protocolo do vizinho"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "Peso"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:38
