msgstr "(Opcional) O valor de peso para preferência de rota"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst
msgid "Keep Alive"
msgstr "Keep Alive"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/bgp_neighbors.rst:39
msgid ""
"(optional) The keepalive interval in seconds (default varies by "
